<#5ab4ff>MYSTIC EYES OF DEATH PERCEPTION</>
Mystic Eyes (gauge full, air too)		^X
  The gauge under you fills as you deal and take damage.
  Full: about 8 seconds where his attacks hit 15% harder,
  God Speed moves get two uses before recharging, Lv1
  supers cancel into Lv2/Lv3, and the Lv2 becomes Instant
  Death. Using a Lv2 or Lv3 ends it. No meter gain while
  it lasts. Works out of blocking as a blowback.
God Speed Dash (front)		^A_+^X
God Speed Dash (behind)		_F^A_+^X
God Speed Dash (up)		_D^A_+^X
God Speed Dash (air, down)		^A_+^X
God Speed Flash (500)		_D_DF_F^A_+^X
God Speed Strike (500)		_D_DB_B^A_+^X
  God Speed moves recharge in about 1.25 seconds
  (paused while the opponent is being hit).

<#5ab4ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab (air too)		^Y
  Hold back to throw the other way.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash / Back Hop		_F_F / _B_B
Air Dash (air)		_F_F / _B_B
Super Jump		_D_U

<#5ab4ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Straight Thrust (hold to charge)		_F^C
  Unblockable at full charge.
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#5ab4ff>SPECIALS</>
  The C versions cost half a bar and work while blocking.
Trump Card No.3		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
A Kick Even I Don't Understand		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Trump Card No.2		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Engrossed Counterattack (air)		_D_D^A / ^B / ^C

<#5ab4ff>SUPERS</>
Trump Card Edge No.3 (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Trump Card Edge No.2 (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Mystic Eyes of Death Perception (2)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^B_+^C
  Becomes Instant Death during Mystic Eyes.
Seventeen Dissection (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
